# Date Picker

A date picker component built on top of Radix Vue and internationalized date utilities, providing a user-friendly calendar interface for selecting dates.

## Installation

::div{.space-y-4}
```bash
bunx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/date-picker.json
```

```bash
npx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/date-picker.json
```

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/date-picker.json
```
::

## Usage

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import { DatePicker } from '@/registry/date-picker'

const date = ref('2024-03-15')
</script>

<template>
  <DatePicker v-model="date" placeholder="Select a date" />
</template>
```

