### Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `modelValue` | `string` | `undefined` | The selected date in ISO format (YYYY-MM-DD). |
| `placeholder` | `string` | `'Pick a date'` | Text to display when no date is selected. |
